41140608,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13488,"speakerName":"ガイサート","textMapHash":3928078050,"text":"ああ。僕の映影理論において、光と影の使い方はまさしく感情の使い方なんだ。","nextNodeIds":[741140611]},{"nodeId":741140611,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13488,"speakerName":"ガイサート","textMapHash":2593055106,"text":"でも…そうだな…今のフォンテーヌの映影業界では、僕の理論はあまり重視されてないんだ。","nextNodeIds":[741140612]},{"nodeId":741140612,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13488,"speakerName":"ガイサート","textMapHash":2498566074,"text":"ほとんどの監督は直接的な動作を多用するし、シーン自体を使って映影のストーリーを表現したりもするね。","nextNodeIds":[741140613]},{"nodeId":741140613,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13488,"speakerName":"ガイサート","textMapHash":1680000226,"text":"僕は純粋な光と影の変化を使って叙情を表現する映影をいくつも制作したけど、ほとんど誰も興味を持ってくれなかった。","nextNodeIds":[741140614]},{"nodeId":741140614,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13488,"speakerName":"ガイサート","textMapHash":1719576098,"text":"でも、今になってやっと一人の監督が僕の光と影の理論に価値があることを認めてくれたんだ。","nextNodeIds":[741140615]},{"nodeId":741140615,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13489,"speakerName":"邱社長","textMapHash":2360375962,"text":"監督？私が？ふふふっ、冗談はやめてくださいよ。ちょっと前まで茶葉を売ってたんですよ？","nextNodeIds":[741140616]},{"nodeId":741140616,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13488,"speakerName":"ガイサート","textMapHash":3881406178,"text":"茶葉商人が監督になれないなんて誰が決めたんだい？僕だって元はしがない記者だった。","nextNodeIds":[741140617]},{"nodeId":741140617,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13489,"speakerName":"邱社長","textMapHash":402077930,"text":"記者…じゃあ、以前は報道記事を書くのも得意だったんでしょう？新聞に載る記事みたいな。","nextNodeIds":[741140618]},{"nodeId":741140618,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13488,"speakerName":"ガイサート","textMapHash":716063986,"text":"まあね。それがどうかしたかい？","nextNodeIds":[741140619]},{"nodeId":741140619,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13489,"speakerName":"邱社長","textMapHash":3429997130,"text":"へえ…ちょうどいいわ…","nextNodeIds":[741140620]},{"nodeId":741140620,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13489,"speakerName":"邱社長","textMapHash":3269456058,"text":"あっ！な、何でもないんです！私たち、これからも協力できそうだなって思って、ふふふっ！","nextNodeIds":[741140621]},{"nodeId":741140621,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_CONSEQUENT_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"","textMapHash":3833902698,"text":"邱社長の朗らかな笑い声の中、皆は席についた。","nextNodeIds":[741140622]},{"nodeId":741140622,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_CONSEQUENT_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"","textMapHash":2534418514,"text":"食事が終わった頃、邱社長はもう一品料理を作ると、それを包んであなたのカバンに押し込んだ…","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":741140609,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2692943538,"text":"光と影は、映影にとってそんなに重要？","nextNodeIds":[741140610]},{"nodeId":741140610,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13488,"speakerName":"ガイサート","textMapHash":2695229866,"text":"もちろんさ。僕の映影理論において、光と影はその画の感情を伝えるための大事な方法だからね。","nextNodeIds":[741140611]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7411406,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_POINT","LNHLPKELCAL":["[1084_8:-9.295,0.000,-2.443,0.000,87.541,0.000]"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":1084,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_ENABLE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_LOCATION"}}},{"subQuestId":7411401,"order":8,"stepDescription":"翌日の朝まで待つ（8時～10時）","stepDescTextMapHash":416718124,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_GAME_TIME_TICK","PPFLKMOMKAI":"8,10"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB"